        "image": {
          "id": "pc-cause-s1",
          "brief": "The rose-mist pusher spirit with its dozen hands: one tilting a small boy's head towards a book, one lifting a spoon to a sleepy ghost's lips, one setting a foot on a path; the Vetāla pointing at each; Dādī laughing.",
          "alt": {
            "en": "A rose-mist spirit with many hands tilts a boy to a book, feeds a sleepy ghost and sets a foot on a path",
            "hi": "गुलाबी धुंध का भूत अनेक हाथों से बालक को पुस्तक की ओर मोड़ता, ऊँघते भूत को खिलाता, राह पर पैर रखता"
